            "value": "Changed by %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chaque changement est signé : qui, quand, quels mots. Le bouton de l'horloge en haut les liste ; « Restaurer ce texte » ramène la version d'avant en un geste.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every change is signed: who, when, which words. The clock button at the top lists them; \"Restore this text\" brings back the earlier version in one tap."
          }
        }
      }
    },
